      "summary": "As a Full Stack Developer with experience in both government and industry environments, I specialize in building scalable web applications and data-driven solutions. I currently work at Varuna Sentinels, developing full-stack applications using Angular, Node.js, Express, and MySQL for systems in the maritime and ship lifecycle management domain.In my current role, I develop RESTful APIs and MySQL stored procedures to support CRUD operations, search, sorting, filtering, pagination, dashboards, and report generation. I have implemented PDF generation with pdfmake, PDF previews using ng2-pdf-viewer, integrated Google Maps APIs for geolocation and distance calculations, and built email functionality with Nodemailer.Previously, as a Project Associate at the Centre for Development of Advanced Computing, Chennai, I focused on Angular front-end development, creating robust web apps with JWT-based authentication, Mapbox GL integration, and Chart.js visualizations. I also developed PWAs using Joget, maintained a Flutter mobile app, managed backend APIs, designed UI with Figma, prepared SRS documents, and supported clients. Hands-on experience with Linux further strengthened my technical skills.I hold a Master’s degree in Computer Applications from Kannur University, which complements my practical experience. During my studies, I collaborated on a Machine Learning Workbench, providing a no-code GUI for model building and a programmer-friendly desktop application to compare multiple algorithms efficiently. The MLW facilitates the evaluation of different algorithms by providing test scores, enabling users to choose the best algorithm for their specific needs.Earlier, as a Laravel Developer Intern at ERE Business Solutions Pvt Ltd, Govt. Cyberpark, I built a multi-vendor subscription management system for newspapers and magazines using Laravel and MySQL, streamlining subscriptions and billing processes.I am eager to explore new opportunities and collaborations within the tech industry. Let’s connect and discuss how my skills and experiences can contribute to the success of your projects.Skills: Angular, Node.js, Express, MySQL, Laravel, Python, Bootstrap, Joget, Git, SQL, HTML, Django",
