      "summary": "𝗝𝗮𝘃𝗮 𝗦𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗕𝗼𝗼𝘁 𝗗𝗲𝘃𝗲𝗹𝗼𝗽𝗲𝗿 with 5 years of experience in application development, I bring a robust set of programming skills and a deep understanding of object-oriented concepts. My technical expertise is in backend development and microservices architecture using 𝗝𝗮𝘃𝗮 𝗦𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗕𝗼𝗼𝘁.\n\nMy professional journey includes:\n\n✔ Backend Development & Microservices: Leveraging 5 years of experience, I've successfully designed and implemented scalable microservices, enhancing system performance and reliability.\n\n✔ Report and Job Generation: With 2 years+ of hands-on experience using 𝗣𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗵𝗼 (𝗣𝗗𝗜, 𝗣𝗥𝗗), I specialize in generating insightful reports and scheduling jobs that streamline business processes.\n\n✔ Database Management: Proficient in 𝗠𝘆𝗦𝗤𝗟 and 𝗣𝗼𝘀𝘁𝗴𝗿𝗲𝗦𝗤𝗟, ensuring efficient data storage and retrieval for various applications.\n\n✔ RESTful Web Services: Skilled in developing robust RESTful APIs with 𝗝𝗮𝘃𝗮 𝗦𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗕𝗼𝗼𝘁. , facilitating seamless integration and communication between different system components.\n\n✔ Persistent Frameworks: Experienced in implementing persistence frameworks such as 𝗦𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗝𝗣𝗔 and 𝗛𝗶𝗯𝗲𝗿𝗻𝗮𝘁𝗲, enabling efficient data handling and management.\n\n✔ CI/CD Tools: With 2 years of experience in continuous integration and continuous deployment using 𝗞𝘂𝗯𝗲𝗿𝗻𝗲𝘁𝗲𝘀 and 𝗝𝗲𝗻𝗸𝗶𝗻𝘀, I've streamlined and automated deployment processes to ensure efficient and reliable software delivery.\n\nI am passionate about continuous learning and staying updated with the latest industry trends and technologies. My goal is to contribute to innovative projects that push the boundaries of what's possible in application development.",
