      "summary": "I am a motivated and detail-oriented Java Backend Developer with a strong foundation in building scalable and efficient backend systems. I specialize in technologies like Java, Spring Boot, Spring MVC, Spring Data JPA, Hibernate, JDBC, RESTful APIs, and MySQL.Currently, I am working in a product-based environment where I contribute to microservices-based architecture, developing and maintaining backend services that integrate with external lender APIs. I have hands-on experience in designing REST APIs, handling Feign and WebClient-based integrations, and customizing business logic based on evolving requirements.I am also involved in bug fixing, code enhancements, and maintaining code quality, ensuring stable and reliable applications. I actively work with modern development practices and continuously explore improvements using updated frameworks and tools.I have practical experience using Temporal for scheduling workflows and managing background processes. Additionally, I have exposure to tools and platforms like Grafana and Rancher for monitoring and logging, along with a working understanding of containerization technologies such as Docker and Kubernetes.I am continuously learning and expanding my knowledge in modern backend technologies, including Kafka and Resilience4j, to build more resilient and scalable systems.I enjoy working in collaborative environments, solving real-world problems, and writing clean, maintainable code. I am passionate about growing as a backend developer and contributing to impactful products.",
