      "summary": "I’m a Computer Science Engineering graduate from Malabar Institute of Technology (CGPA: 7.14) with hands-on experience in building responsive and scalable web applications using the MERN stack.\n\n🔁 Career Journey\nI began my development career with a React.js internship at Direct Axis Solutions, where I worked on five key projects, including a movie app and an e-commerce platform.\nI then completed a MERN Stack internship at Upcode Software Labs, building full-stack applications and integrating RESTful APIs.\nCurrently, I’m working as an Application Developer at Kiebot, where I transitioned from a trainee role and continue to contribute to real-world frontend and backend projects.\n\n🛠️ Core Skills\nReact.js | JavaScript | HTML | CSS | Node.js | Express.js | MongoDB | REST APIs | Git | UI/UX\n\n📈 Career Goals\nI’m passionate about building clean, user-focused interfaces and aim to grow into a full-stack or frontend lead role while contributing to open-source and impactful tech solutions.\n\n📩 Let’s connect: fathimathushifana1@gmail.com",
