          "description": "I own the Product Authorization Platform, the infrastructure layer that decides who gets access to what across every Adobe desktop, web, and mobile app. This platform sits at the intersection of commerce, identity, and AI monetization, operating at Adobe scale\n\nWhat I work on:\n\nGenAI Monetization & Metering — I lead the metering and entitlement layer for Adobe's generative AI features (Firefly, Express, and more), defining how AI-generated outputs are measured, priced, and enforced. This includes credit systems, quota management, rate limiting, and usage-based billing models that power Adobe's GenAI commercial strategy.\n\nUser Entitlements & Subscription Lifecycle — End-to-end ownership of how users acquire, activate, upgrade, and retain access to Adobe products. This spans license creation, delegation, trial conversions, renewals, and request-access flows across B2B and B2C segments.\n\nIn-App Commerce — I drive top-of-funnel conversion and engagement through in-app upsells, upgrade prompts, and trial-to-paid flows embedded directly in the product experience, connecting usage signals to commercial moments.\n\nAccess Enforcement at Scale — The platform enforces authorization decisions in real time across all Adobe surfaces, handling entitlement checks, geo-restrictions, bad-actor detection, and compliance guardrails for millions of users.",
