      "summary": "🌟 Passionate Multifaceted Professional 🌟<br><br>💻 MERN Stack |👗 Fashion Designer | 📱 Mobile Technician | 🎓 BA Economics Graduate  <br><br>As a versatile professional with diverse experiences and a thirst for knowledge, I've journeyed through multiple fields, each contributing to my growth and skill set. Starting my career as a fashion designer, I honed my creativity and attention to detail, crafting unique designs and exploring trends in the industry.<br><br>Transitioning into the realm of technology, I embraced the world of mobile devices, serving as a mobile technician. This role sharpened my problem-solving abilities and technical expertise, allowing me to troubleshoot and resolve various hardware and software issues.<br><br>Building on my passion for economics, I pursued a degree in BA Economics, delving into the complexities of markets, policies, and global trends. This academic journey provided me with a solid foundation in analytical thinking and strategic decision-making.<br><br>Currently, I am embarking on an exciting new chapter as an intern in software development, specializing in the MERN (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js) stack. This role merges my diverse background and interests, allowing me to fuse creativity with technology and contribute to innovative solutions in the digital landscape.<br><br>I am driven by curiosity, a thirst for learning, and a desire to make meaningful contributions wherever I go. I am excited to continue exploring new horizons, pushing boundaries, and leveraging my unique blend of skills and experiences to create positive impact.<br><br>Let's connect and explore opportunities to collaborate and innovate together! 🚀",
